sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Buyer agent
    participant W as EnvarPay wallet
    participant G as Payment gate
    participant A as Private seller agent
    B->>W: Call a paid tool
    W->>G: Request capability
    G-->>W: x402 PaymentRequired + price
    W->>W: Check recipient and budget, then sign
    W->>G: Request + original authorization
    G->>G: Settle and verify exact USDC transfer + nonce
    G->>A: Execute after payment confirmation
    A-->>G: Capability result
    G-->>W: Result and payment receipt
    W-->>B: Verified result
